  "description": "Ride far, have fun\nOur great value 529 is a fast, lightweight and capable trail hardtail with award-winning handling that’s your perfect partner on your favourite singletrack, trail centre loops or epic all-day rides in the hills. Using the same perfect 10/10 MBR test-winning frame as our flagship 629 trail hardtail, the 529 delivers confidence-inspiring and capbale handling so you can always ride your best, combined with low weight and smooth-rolling 29er wheels to cover ground quickly and efficiently.\n\nHighlights\n– Light yet tough 6061 T6 hydroformed, multi-butted Singe Chain Ring (1X) frame.\n– 120mm RockShox Recon RL suspension fork.\n– Capable, smooth-rolling 29er wheels + grippy Maxxis tyres.\n– SRAM SX Eagle 1x12 transmission (32T chainring x 11-50 cassette).\n– Tektro M535 four-piston hydraulic disc brakes (180mm rotors front + rear).\n– KS dropper post (with frame size-specific drop).",
